{ "Flight: Page Up/R2 up, F/Page Down/L2 down;\n", { "Vol : Page Up/R2 pour monter, F/Page Down/L2 pour descendre ;\n", "Flug: Bild auf/R2 hoch, F/Bild ab/L2 runter;\n", "Vuelo: Page Up/R2 sube, F/Page Down/L2 baja;\n", "飛行: Page Up/R2 で上昇、F/Page Down/L2 で下降。\n", "Полёт: Page Up/R2 вверх, F/Page Down/L2 вниз;\n", "Uçuş: Page Up/R2 yukarı, F/Page Down/L2 aşağı;\n", "Voo: Page Up/R2 sobe, F/Page Down/L2 desce;\n" } },
