{ "Use a European Resident Evil Code: Veronica X disc (%s).", { "Utilisez un disque européen de Resident Evil Code: Veronica X (%s).", "Verwenden Sie eine europäische Disc von Resident Evil Code: Veronica X (%s).", "Usa un disco europeo de Resident Evil Code: Veronica X (%s).", "ヨーロッパ版 Resident Evil Code: Veronica X のディスク（%s）を使ってください。", "Используйте европейский диск Resident Evil Code: Veronica X (%s).", "Avrupa sürümü bir Resident Evil Code: Veronica X diski kullanın (%s).", "Use um disco europeu de Resident Evil Code: Veronica X (%s)." } },
